        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kitchen Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in this co-op cooking roguelite where every shift is a fresh challenge. Prepare dishes under pressure, and serve demanding customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/f5f4a587ace05ae3dbc79c71929f57c1.poster.avif?t=1758614007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/f5f4a587ace05ae3dbc79c71929f57c1.webm?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/f5f4a587ace05ae3dbc79c71929f57c1.mp4?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hostile Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the heat? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between impatient patrons, area hazards and temperamental equipment, you'll need to use all the utensils to keep your kitchen running. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/2cb5f5466d5b1534ed50730c3f9e4690.poster.avif?t=1758614007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/2cb5f5466d5b1534ed50730c3f9e4690.webm?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/2cb5f5466d5b1534ed50730c3f9e4690.mp4?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customise on the fly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a Smörgåsbord of cards to expand your kitchen with new ingredients, counters, and upgrades. Add new recipes to increase your reputation and earn greater rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Specalise your skillet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your skills as you play! <br>Put points into different talent trees that you can swap out before you clock in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creature Comforts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a cat. It's somewhat useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/0b91eca64f68969b52546a2223793597.poster.avif?t=1758614007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/0b91eca64f68969b52546a2223793597.webm?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/0b91eca64f68969b52546a2223793597.mp4?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kitchen Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends in this co-op cooking roguelite where every shift is a fresh challenge. Prepare dishes under pressure, and serve demanding customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/f5f4a587ace05ae3dbc79c71929f57c1.poster.avif?t=1758614007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/f5f4a587ace05ae3dbc79c71929f57c1.webm?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/f5f4a587ace05ae3dbc79c71929f57c1.mp4?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hostile Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the heat? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between impatient patrons, area hazards and temperamental equipment, you'll need to use all the utensils to keep your kitchen running. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/2cb5f5466d5b1534ed50730c3f9e4690.poster.avif?t=1758614007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/2cb5f5466d5b1534ed50730c3f9e4690.webm?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/2cb5f5466d5b1534ed50730c3f9e4690.mp4?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customise on the fly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a Smörgåsbord of cards to expand your kitchen with new ingredients, counters, and upgrades. Add new recipes to increase your reputation and earn greater rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Specalise your skillet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your skills as you play! <br>Put points into different talent trees that you can swap out before you clock in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creature Comforts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a cat. It's somewhat useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/0b91eca64f68969b52546a2223793597.poster.avif?t=1758614007\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/0b91eca64f68969b52546a2223793597.webm?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620210/extras/0b91eca64f68969b52546a2223793597.mp4?t=1758614007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
